data: {"session_id":"629d0b6f-15ea-4f2a-ab8e-4d5f65c9c7d8","seq":122,"kind":"assistant","payload":{"attachments":["/workspace/kanban/shot1_add1.png","/workspace/kanban/shot2_add2.png","/workspace/kanban/shot3_add3.png","/workspace/kanban/shot_after_move.png","/workspace/kanban/shot_after_reload.png"],"text":"Kanban app built in /workspace/kanban (Python backend serving the board and persisting cards to cards.json) and running in the background on port 8000.\n\nVerified end-to-end with the browser:\n- Added three cards: \"Write report\", \"Fix bug\", \"Deploy app\" (screenshots shot1_add1.png, shot2_add2.png, shot3_add3.png).\n- Moved \"Write report\" to Done (shot_after_move.png).\n- Reloaded the page — all three cards persisted with \"Write report\" still in Done (shot_after_reload.png), confirmed both in the page state and in cards.json on disk.\n\nEverything worked; no fixes were needed."},"at":1793934421388}

